  "uid": "nexus-service-objectives",
  "title": "Nexus \u00b7 Service objectives",
  "description": "Proposed lab objectives for API responses. Partial observations are separate from complete 30-day results; no production or browser availability claim.",
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "environment",
        "label": "Environment",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "nexus-prometheus"
        },
        "query": {
          "query": "label_values(nexus_observability_refresh_success{job=\"spring-backend\"}, environment)",
          "refId": "environments"
        },
        "definition": "label_values(nexus_observability_refresh_success{job=\"spring-backend\"}, environment)",
        "refresh": 1,
        "sort": 1,
        "multi": false,
        "includeAll": false,
        "current": {},
        "options": []
      },
      {
        "name": "slo",
        "label": "Objective",
        "type": "custom",
        "query": "inventory-availability,order-availability,inventory-latency",
        "current": {
          "text": "inventory-availability",
          "value": "inventory-availability"
        },
        "options": [],
        "multi": false,
        "includeAll": false
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Interpretation",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 5
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### Proposed engineering objectives \u2014 local lab\nInventory lookup and order creation: **99.9% successful eligible API responses**. Inventory lookup: **99% successful within 500 ms**. Eligible responses: 2xx, 429, 5xx on the selected route/method. No traffic gives no ratio; missing telemetry gives unknown. Complete 30-day results require an uninterrupted month of valid recorded observations; until then use the explicitly partial figures. Long-window figures update hourly. Requests that never reach the API are outside these objectives.\n\n[Contract and error-budget policy](https://github.com/JanLancelot/nexus-supply-chain/blob/main/docs/service-objectives.md) \u00b7 [Response runbook](https://github.com/JanLancelot/nexus-supply-chain/blob/main/docs/runbooks/slo-burn.md)"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Observed attainment \u00b7 last 5 minutes",
      "description": "",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "nexus-prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 5
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "(1 - nexus:slo_bad:ratio5m{environment=\"$environment\",slo=\"$slo\"}) and on (job, application, environment, slo) (nexus:slo_sample_valid{environment=\"$environment\",slo=\"$slo\"} == 1)",
          "legendFormat": "{{slo}}",
          "instant": true,
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "nexus-prometheus"
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "noValue": "Unknown / insufficient traffic",
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "blue"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "blue",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "none",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        }
      }
    },
